{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11103090","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11103090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1110309001:1":{"text":"후...","source_cn":"呼——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB797FA5279E25B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110309002:1":{"text":"언제까지 심호흡만 할 거야? 브루투스 님을 기다리게 할 거야?","source_cn":"你还要深呼吸到什么时候？难道要让布鲁特斯大人等着你吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B1B79FEB765F033","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110309003:1":{"text":"아니야! 브루투스 님, 마지막 일격이... 정말 대단했습니다.","source_cn":"我才不会！布鲁特斯大人，您最后一击……相当精彩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3243B35880331F5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110309004:1":{"text":"젊은이, 너의 무술도 나이에 비해 꽤 인상적이구나. 우르 부족의...","source_cn":"年轻人，你的武艺在这个年纪也相当不俗。乌尔氏族的——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFC3C9BA30CBB3CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110309005:1":{"text":"소렌입니다! 브루투스 님! 소렌이라고 해요. 저, 저는 아르사고요.","source_cn":"索恩！布鲁特斯大人，他叫索恩！我……我叫阿尔萨！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC15FA2E91B5C73DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110309006:1":{"text":"아르사와 소렌? 좋아, 드디어 얼굴이 이름과 매치되었구나.","source_cn":"阿尔萨和索恩？很好，终于把你们的名字跟脸对上了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19C0F15429BD00CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110309007:1":{"text":"저, 저희를 아세요?","source_cn":"您，您知道我们？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E3089A120D9AC86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110309008:1":{"text":"칼라가 너희를 정중하게 소개했어... 첫 출전 만에 시련을 통과한 차세대는 몇 년 만이라면서 말이야.","source_cn":"曼卡拉可是隆重地跟我介绍了你们——多年未曾有过，初次参...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC22E0DEB42F2909","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110309009:1":{"text":"아아아아! 브루투스 님이 우리 이름을 알고 계시다니... 아얏! 왜 꼬집어! 꿈이라고 생각한 거야?","source_cn":"啊啊啊啊！布鲁特斯大人知道我们的名字——嗷！你掐我干嘛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07B2D1A8A05C615E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110309010:1":{"text":"... 미안! 그저... 이 모든 게 거짓말 같아서.","source_cn":"……抱歉，只是……这一切，太不像真的了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94E5775555E5AEF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1110309010":{"text":"... 미안! 그저... 이 모든 게 거짓말 같아서.","source_cn":"……抱歉，只是……这一切，太不像真的了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94E5775555E5AEF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110309011:2":{"text":"소렌, 아르사, 방금 전투에서 너희는 수적으로 열세인데다 약자까지 보호해야 했어...","source_cn":"索恩，阿尔萨，刚才那场战斗，你们以寡敌众，还要保护弱小——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18B51DA0EB8096E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110309012:1":{"text":"공정하지 않은 전투인데도 강적과 맞서 위축되지 않았지.","source_cn":"这并不是一场公平的战斗，但你们面对强敌时，从未退缩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x728FDEB0A3A03B4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110309013:1":{"text":"그럼, “영혼의 시련”에서도 이런 강인함을 유지할 수 있겠지?","source_cn":"那么，在“魂之试炼”中，你们能保持这份坚强吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAFD712A17EEE859","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110309014:1":{"text":"네! 아무리 두려운 적이라 해도 절대 도망치지 않을 거예요.","source_cn":"嗯。无论敌人何等可怕，我们都绝不会临阵脱逃。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24E0061EBBDD939B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110309015:1":{"text":"오? 두려운 적이라.","source_cn":"哦？可怕的敌人吗？","